ou can exchange it in <a href=\"/page/Eveningstar\" title=\"Eveningstar\">Eveningstar</a> for powerful equipment.</span></span></li>\n<li>3&#32;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Commendation_of_Heroism\" title=\"Item:Commendation of Heroism\">Commendations of Heroism</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Commendation_of_Heroism\" title=\"Item:Commendation of Heroism\">Commendation of Heroism</a>:</b> This is a valuable item that can be exchanged for goods if brought to a Challenge Trader.  You can exchange it in <a href=\"/page/Eveningstar\" title=\"Eveningstar\">Eveningstar</a> for powerful equipment.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817040044\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.088 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.150 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4630/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 37396/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14470/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n108.60%  139.925     63 Template:IO\n100.00%  128.845      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  128.845      1 -total\n 96.12%  123.841      1 Template:Named_Armor\n 37.34%   48.109      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 36.69%   47.271     